*> vybe-test: cobol/data_group_level/data_group_two_level_display
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_data_group_level.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 RECORD.
   05 FIRST-NAME PIC X(5) VALUE "ALICE".
   05 LAST-NAME  PIC X(5) VALUE "JONES".
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY FIRST-NAME.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING FIRST-NAME DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "ALICE"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [ALICE] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY LAST-NAME.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING LAST-NAME DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "JONES"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [JONES] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

